        "thought_text": "To avoid generating all possible subsets of coins that sum up to k and then finding all possible sums of subsets of those subsets, we can use a more efficient approach. Instead, we can directly generate all possible sums of subsets of the given coins and keep track of which sums are achievable. This way, we can determine the values that Arya can make with the coins used to pay for the chocolate.",
